# Security / crypto

- No custom crypto; use established crates (`snow`, `argon2`, `blake3`, `zeroize`)
- Constant-time compares for secrets/auth proofs
- Zeroize secret material on drop
- Never log secrets, keys, passwords, or raw pixels
- Validate all lengths from the wire before allocate/copy
- Relay/signal must not decrypt session media
- Password only via challenge-response inside E2E channel
- Fuzz parsers when touching decode paths (P8+)
